    <briefdescription>
<para>Uninitialized element access error. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="classcslt_1_1UninitializedError" kindref="compound">UninitializedError</ref> represents an error when attempting to access an element or object that has not been properly initialized.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="par"><title>Example Usage:</title><para><programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal">throw<sp/>UninitializedError();<sp/><sp/>//<sp/>&quot;Uninitialized<sp/>element<sp/>access&quot;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">throw<sp/>UninitializedError(&quot;Attempting<sp/>to<sp/>read<sp/>uninitialized<sp/>variable&quot;);</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
